### GET request to example server
GET https://examples.http-client.intellij.net/get
    ?generated-in=IntelliJ IDEA

###
### 1. Create a valid expense (Expect: 201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Groceries and fresh produce",
  "amount": 1850.50,
  "category": "Food",
  "date": "2026-11-23"
}

### 2. Trigger validation errors (Expect: 400 Bad Request with field errors)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "",
  "amount": -100,
  "category": "",
  "date": "2026-11-23"
}

### 3. Get all expenses (Expect: 200 OK with JSON array)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/expenses

### 4. Update expense ID 1 (Expect: 200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Supermarket groceries",
  "amount": 2100.00,
  "category": "Food",
  "date": "2026-11-23"
}

### 5. Trigger 404 Not Found error (Expect: 404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/999

### 6. Delete expense ID 1 (Expect: 204 No Content)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/1

